{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04","cat":"bond","group":{"id":"char5101","label":"Red Hood"},"label":"The Value Of The Ark","stage":null,"prev":"d_nikke_RedHood_03","next":"d_nikke_RedHood_05","speakers":{"neon":"Neon","redhood":"Red Hood","anis":"Anis"},"icons":{"neon":"si_c011_00_s","redhood":"si_c470_00_s","anis":"si_c012_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_1","text":"Well, first off,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Desert_02_n","bgArt":"desert_02_n","image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":["redhood","anis","neon"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_2","text":"it's got a lot of people in it, and it's super noisy.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_backtonormal","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_3","text":"It's crowded even when there's nothing going on, and it's way worse whenever an event is being held.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_4","text":"You barely even have room to stand.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_5","text":"That's why I've been practicing throwing people over my shoulder.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_6","text":"Ha!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_7","text":"Seriously? That groaner of a joke actually made you laugh?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_8","text":"Since there are so many people around, you're always meeting interesting people,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_9","text":"and from all walks of life, too.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_10","text":"Generally speaking, I'd say people in the Ark live a decent life. People at least don't go hungry, which can't be said for the Outer Rim.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Park","bgArt":"park","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_11","text":"There are buildings everywhere,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_12","text":"with skyscrapers as far as the eye can see and people going in and out of them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_13","text":"Oooh, and there's a whole bunch of trains.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Station","bgArt":"station","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_14","text":"It's fun riding the rails and letting your mind wander.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_15","text":"But the best thing of all is the internet.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_16","text":"It's blazing fast, and you can do just about anything on it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"NikkeRoom","bgArt":"nikkeroom","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_17","text":"You could spend all day inside and never get bored.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_18","text":"Let's see, what else did I miss...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_19","text":"Oh, food.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"FastFood","bgArt":"fastfood","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_20","text":"There's an artificial food called Splendamin, which can be processed into all kinds of flavors.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_21","text":"Opinions on it are mixed, but I personally love the stuff to death.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_22","text":"What about music?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Restaurant","bgArt":"restaurant","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_23","text":"There are lots and lots of singers, some of whom are Nikkes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_24","text":"Wow.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["redhood"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_25","text":"So,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Desert_02_n","bgArt":"desert_02_n","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_26","text":"I think it's fair to say that the Ark is a nice place.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_27","text":"Your friend over here seems to feel differently.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_28","text":"Me?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_29","text":"Yes, you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_30","text":"Well...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_31","text":"Come on, tell me. How do you feel about the Ark?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_32","text":"I'd better not. I've got a nasty habit of talking too much.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_33","text":"It doesn't matter. I want to hear it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_34","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_35","text":"Its infrastructure is remarkable, that much is true.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_crawlinganxiety","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_36","text":"Nikkes are assigned to handle all the dangerous jobs, so it's safe as well.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_37","text":"But the humans who live there are just the worst.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_38","text":"Anis...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_39","text":"It's okay, go on.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_40","text":"No one thinks about the future. All they do is waste time on frivolous activities.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_41","text":"They spend their days aimlessly roaming the streets after getting rip-roaring drunk. They turn a blind eye to any crimes they witness.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_42","text":"No one cares about their fellow man, and humility has long since gone out the window.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_43","text":"They believe money is the cure for all problems, the cruelest irony of all is that, time and time again, reality has proven them correct.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_44","text":"I see none of the positive aspects of human nature on display.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_45","text":"If someone shows weakness, the others pounce on them or ostracize them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_46","text":"And when they think they are superior to others, they become exceedingly cruel.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_47","text":"To me...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_48","text":"there is a dark side to the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_49","text":"We haven't known each other for too long, but I imagine you're not much like those people you've just described.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_50","text":"No, because I don't want the same things in life that they do.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_51","text":"There must be a lot of people who feel the same as you do.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_52","text":"Maybe.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_53","text":"But, if I'm being honest, what makes me so different?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_54","text":"I'm just like them. Another nobody trapped inside the Ark who can't do anything about it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_55","text":"I think I understand now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_56","text":"It is just an ordinary living space like any other.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_57","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_RedHood_04_58","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_RedHood_04_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"L